WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.501
Peter ran toward the trash pile.

2
00:00:16.502 --> 00:00:27.433
So did Mopsy and Cotton-tail.

3
00:00:27.434 --> 00:00:35.061
Flopsy slowly hopped after them.

4
00:00:35.062 --> 00:00:39.825
She was worried about the farmer.

5
00:00:39.826 --> 00:00:43.170
Flopsy saw lots of trash.

6
00:00:43.171 --> 00:00:51.620
There were bags and pots and old boots.

7
00:00:51.621 --> 00:00:57.117
Peter sniffed the air.

8
00:00:57.118 --> 00:01:01.531
"I smell rotting vegetables!" he said.

9
00:01:01.532 --> 00:01:06.431
"I see lots of flies," said Cotton-tail.

10
00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:11.429
Suddenly the bunnies spotted something green.

11
00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:16.619
"Mmm!" cried Mopsy. "Lettuce!"

12
00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:26.731
"Peas!" cried Cotton-tail.

13
00:01:26.732 --> 00:01:34.387
"Come on, Flopsy. Let's eat!"

14
00:01:34.388 --> 00:01:41.339
Even Flopsy ate peas and lettuce.

15
00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:45.995
Soon the bunnies were very full.

16
00:01:45.996 --> 00:01:53.082
The sun felt very warm.

17
00:01:53.083 --> 00:02:01.532
Three bunnies fell asleep.

18
00:02:01.533 --> 00:02:04.883
Flopsy was tired too.

19
00:02:04.884 --> 00:02:07.734
But she could not sleep.

20
00:02:07.735 --> 00:02:11.014
She was worried about the farmer.

21
00:02:11.015 --> 00:02:15.382
And Mother was coming home soon.

22
00:02:15.383 --> 00:02:17.948
Bzz . . . Bzz . . .

23
00:02:17.949 --> 00:02:21.003
Flies buzzed around Flopsy's head.

24
00:02:21.004 --> 00:02:25.985
"Ugh!" Flopsy swatted the flies.

25
00:02:25.986 --> 00:02:30.868
Then Flopsy spotted a paper bag.

26
00:02:30.869 --> 00:02:33.722
She put the bag over her head.

27
00:02:33.723 --> 00:02:36.866
"Now the flies won't bother me.

28
00:02:36.867 --> 00:02:45.256
And soon we will go home."

29
00:02:45.257 --> 00:02:49.687
Suddenly Flopsy heard a sound.

30
00:02:49.688 --> 00:02:55.157
"Shh!" Mrs. Tittlemouse ran toward her.

31
00:02:55.158 --> 00:02:59.069
"You must hide!" the mouse whispered.

32
00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:05.774
"The farmer is coming!"
